 an Viola Society's Career Achievement Award (June 2018)\; the Internation
 al Viola Society's Silver Alto Clef 2018 ("in recognition for his outstan
 ding contributions to the to the viola")\; and the IU Trustees Teaching A
 ward (2019). Arad plays on a viola by Niccolo Amati and uses PI strings b
 y Thomastik.<br /><br />  A soloist of international distinction\, violin
