 at conductors\, including Ormandy\, Rattle\, Maazel\, Masur\, Dutoit\, Sa
 lonen\, Semkov\, Skrowaczewski\, and Tennstedt. He has made highly acclai
 med concerto and recital appearances in all the musical centers of Americ
 a and Europe\, as well as in Australia\, New Zealand\, Malaysia\, Hong Ko
 ng\, China and Singapore. Kaplan is also devoted to chamber music\, appea
 ring with pianist Yael Weiss and cellist Peter Stumpf as the Weiss-Kaplan
 -Stumpf Trio\, with recordings and concert tours world-wide. Prior to tha
