 d Schumann\, as well as two complete recordings of Bach's solo violin wor
 ks. Since 2005\, he has been professor of music in violin at the Indiana 
 University Jacobs School of Music\, following a decade as professor at UC
 LA. Kaplan is a graduate of The Juilliard School\, where he studied with 
