LOCATION:MUSICAL ARTS CENTER (MAC)
GEO:39.166571;-86.517459
SUMMARY:JSoM Performing Arts Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're in your first year of your degree or getting r
 eady to graduate\, the first annual JSOM Career Fair is a great opportuni
 ty for students of all disciplines at Jacobs to connect with regional emp
 loyers\, learn about career paths in performing arts\, and explore intern
 ships and job opportunities. The focus of this fair will be employers int
 erested in attracting professionals with skills and experience in perform
 ance and applied teaching in music\, dance\, and theatre. Watch your IU i
 nbox for information on how to prepare for thefair\, and schedule an appo
 intment with a career advisor to make sure your resumé is fair-ready!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW200006778 
 BCX0">Whether you're in your first year of your degree or getting ready t
 o graduate\, the first annual JSOM Career Fair is a great opportunity for
  students of all disciplines at Jacobs to connect with regional employers
 \, learn about career paths in performing arts\, and explore internships 
 and job opportunities. The focus of this fair will be employers intereste
 d in attracting professionals with skills and experience in performance a
 nd applied teaching in music\, dance\, and theatre. Watch your IU inbox f
 or information on how to prepare for the</span><span class="NormalTextRun
  ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW200006778 BCX0">fair</span
 ><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW200006778 BCX0">\, and schedule an appoin
 tment with a career advisor to make sure your resumé is fair-ready!</spa
 n></p>
