 t churches\, cathedrals\, and concert halls all over the world\, started 
 with awards at several important international competitions\, including t
 he competition of the German Broadcasting Corporations in Munich 1979 and
  the Grand Prix de Chartres 1982\, among others. Born in Herne in 1954\, 
 he studied organ with Wolfgang Stockmeier and harpsichord with Hugo Ruf a
 t Cologne Musikhochschule. While writing his musicology Ph.D. dissertatio
