 elen Ford\, cello (guest)<br />  Michael Grubb\, narrator (guest)<br />  
 Maria Izzo\, soprano (alumna guest)<br />  Emily Nehus\, violin (alumna g
 uest)<br />  Paulina Villarreal\, mezzo-soprano/narrator<br /><strong><br
  />  Repertoire<br /></strong>Chappell Kingsland: <em>Confessions of a Mu
 rderess (2011)<br /></em>Anthony Plog: <em>Animal Ditties I (1978)<br /><
